    <description>
<en><![CDATA[
Category: Medium Tractors
Price: $68,000
Power: 175 hp
Max. speed: 40 kph

Transmissions: PowrQuad 20/20, AutoQuad II 20/20 (40 or 50 km/h), Powershift 19/7, IVT AutoPowr (40 or 50 km/h, internal LOW/HIGH ranges). 50 km/h versions: power boost 196 hp with PTO or above 30 km/h.

Controls - while driving (left hand: LAlt + left keyboard block):
- Displays: LAlt+1/2/3/4 centre LCD A/B/C/D, LAlt+5 JD controls HUD
- Performance Monitor: LAlt+Q/W previous/next display, LAlt+E ZERO, LAlt+R width step
- Driving: LAlt+A/S hand throttle -/+, LAlt+F heading lock, LAlt+G HMS headland management, LAlt+T both implements; park lock: Right Alt (or LAlt+6)
- Drivetrain: LAlt+Y MFWD AUTO/ON/BRAKE ASSIST, LAlt+X rear differential lock, LAlt+C IVT band 1/2/AUTO, LAlt+V/B IVT set speed -/+
Controls - standing (numeric keypad):
- LCtrl+Num 9 transmission mode (AutoQuad MANUAL/AUTO/ECO, IVT selector OFF/1/2/3)
- RShift+Num +/- tyre pressure (hold)
Game keys / H-shifter: AutoQuad ranges A-E = gears, steps 1-4 = groups; Powershift steps 1-19 = groups.
Interactive Control: click the Performance Monitor, GreenStar terminal, V selector and phone.
Physics: realistic shifting, MFWD torque split, traction by tyre size/duals/ballast/soil/moisture/pressure (Brixius), rolling resistance, implement draft, real PTO speeds.
Engine and transmission sounds: Farming Dud's (Vassili_k98), from FS25_FD_johnDeereSeries7010 - personal use

Changelog Version 1.0.0.2:
- Added 1.5m narrow wheel configurations
- Fixed side engine grid color

Changelog Version 1.0.0.1:
- Improved dashboard
- Improved animation performance
- Various visual adjustments
]]></en>
